<title>USA: Coastal holders ok Scott nominees, proposal.</title>
<headline>Coastal holders ok Scott nominees, proposal.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, N.C. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Physician Group Inc said Monday that two nominees of ousted Coastal founder Steven Scott received 53 percent of the votes according to preliminary results from its contested September 27 meeting.</p>
<p>Scott's winning nominees were Mitchell Berger and Henry Murphy.</p>
<p>In preliminary results, Coastal shareholders also approved Scott's non-binding resolution calling for the Board to immediately establish a Shareholder Value Committee, Coastal said.</p>
</text>
